{
 "_说明": [
  "智能体登记表。kind: block=往全局说明文件里插一段带标记的块；file=在全局规则目录里放一个独立文件；manual=没有可写的全局文件，打印出来让用户粘贴，或用项目级 AGENTS.md。",
  "status: tested=作者本机实测过；docs=按官方文档写，未在作者本机实测；guess=根据公开信息推测，欢迎提 PR 纠正。",
  "路径记号：~ 用户目录；{APPSUPPORT} = macOS ~/Library/Application Support、Linux ~/.config、Windows %APPDATA%；{DOCUMENTS} = ~/Documents。",
  "表里没有的智能体：在库的 fm.config.json 的 custom_agents 里按同样格式加一条即可。",
  "memory：这个智能体自己的规则/记忆文件，首次汇集（collect）时会把其中我们没写过的内容放进投放区。用 a|b 表示按顺序取第一个存在的（新旧版本路径不同时用）。"
 ],
 "agents": [
  {
   "id": "claude-code",
   "name": "Claude Code（命令行/桌面端/IDE 插件）",
   "kind": "block",
   "path": "~/.claude/CLAUDE.md",
   "detect": [
    "~/.claude"
   ],
   "status": "tested",
   "harvest": "claude",
   "headless": "claude -p --permission-mode acceptEdits --allowedTools \"Bash(python3:*)\" {prompt}",
   "memory": [
    "~/.claude/CLAUDE.md",
    "~/.claude/projects/*/memory/*.md"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "codex",
   "name": "OpenAI Codex（命令行/桌面端/IDE 插件）",
   "kind": "block",
   "path": "~/.codex/AGENTS.md",
   "detect": [
    "~/.codex"
   ],
   "status": "tested",
   "harvest": "codex",
   "headless": "codex exec --full-auto {prompt}",
   "note": "写入与对话采集已实测；汇集只读 memories/memory_summary.md（精华），明细和原始记忆由对话采集覆盖",
   "memory": [
    "~/.codex/AGENTS.md",
    "~/.codex/memories_v2/memory_summary.md|~/.codex/memories/memory_summary.md|~/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "gemini-cli",
